  "description": "HJ-Story all started out as simple drawings sent to Andrew Hou's girlfriend, now wife, via iphone sms. He wasn't good with words so whenever he had time he drew doodles and uploaded to my phone and sent to her. Originally, they were posted on a private blog but a friend of his posted them publicly and the drawings started to gain an audience.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://webtoon.daum.net/league/view/8119)",
